    <briefdescription>
<para>Small buffer optimization for UTF strings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Strings up to 32 bytes total (including metadata) are stored inline on the stack. Actual data capacity is 32 - 2*sizeof(size_t) bytes. <simplesect kind="note"><para>StorageType must be trivially copyable (enforced by static_assert) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
